# Departmental Security Awareness Analysis Based on Abnormal Login Data

## Executive Summary

This analysis identifies departments with relatively weak security awareness based on historical abnormal login data (year 2024). Using multiple metrics, we highlight which departments need prioritized security awareness guidance.

**Key Findings:**
- **Sales Department** shows the highest confirmed anomaly rate (58.7%) and highest per-user confirmed risk score, indicating actual security incidents are most prevalent there.
